ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=functional_tooling_implemented roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Deno functional core tooling verified" notes="Added Deno tasks, pinned functional and ESLint dependencies, core functional primitives, and colocated atomic/seam/live test files. mise run verify passed Deno lint, ESLint, type checking, and four non-live tests; mise run test-live passed the explicit live convention."
ts=2026-08-18T00:00:00Z actor=opencode event=svelte_dependency_added roadmap=cloudmappr status=active summary="Standalone Svelte consumer dependency added" notes="Installed svelte 5.56.9 without SvelteKit and routed the wrapper boundary: map behavior remains in the framework-neutral MJS controller; a future Svelte component only owns lifecycle and prop/event translation."
